<<if ($foodstuff[$phase2].recipe)>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 100>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>." You answer almost automatically. <span class="green">You're a natural.</span>
		<br><br>
		"Makes sense," Avery says as <<he>> steps away from the doorframe. 
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			"Don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards."
            <br><br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
				<<He>> returns to the dining room. You will have to come back to it later. For now, Avery is hungry.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			Just leave it for the maid to clean. <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>>" <<He>> leaves the kitchen.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" You don't sound convincing at all.
		<br><br>
		Avery looks at you for a while, before chuckling "<span class="green">Alright, keep your secrets.</span> I'll trust your surprise.
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			Just don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards."
		<<else>>
			Just be careful in the future."
		<</if>>
		<<He>> releases the doorframe and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
	<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
		"I wanted to cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>." You answer almost automatically, as if you didn't come up with that recipe on the spot."
		<br><br>
		Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow in surprise. "<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>? I never asked you to make it for me before," <<He>> ponders for a moment and smiles in recognition. "I'll keep that in mind." <<He>> steps away from the doorframe with a smile on <<his>> face.  
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			Don't forget to clean the kitchen afterwards."
            <br><br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
				<<He>> returns to the dining room. You will have to come back to it later. For now, Avery is hungry.
			<<else>>
				<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			Just leave it for the maid to clean. <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>I'll be waiting in the dining room.<</if>>
            <br>.<br>
			<<He>> leaves the kitchen.
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		"I wanted to cook... <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>?" You manage to get a recipe name that you assume is made with <<recipe_name $phase>>.
		<br><br>
		Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow in suspicion. "<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>? I didn't know you knew this one." <<He>> stops for a moment. "Alright. Change of plans. <span class="pink">Make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">> instead of <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">></span>."<<set $daily.avery.faceRequest to true>> Avery smirks. 
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			"Oh, and don't forget to clean the kitchen up afterwards."
            <br><br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">><<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and returns to the dining room. You will have to come back to it later. For now, Avery is hungry.<<else>><<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and leaves the kitchen. You are in trouble.<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
            <<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

"I crave raw meat," you announce nonchalantly, your animalistic nature taking controle for a moment. Avery just stares at you for a moment in bewilderment, waiting for further explanation.
<br><br>
<<link [[Bite into the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> to prove a point|Mansion Steal Raw Prove]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Explain|Mansion Steal Raw Explain]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Mansion Steal Raw Silent]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Prove
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

You bite into the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> slowly. It's actually very good, it makes you happy.
<br><br>
You devour the rest of the <<recipe_name $phase "article">> quickly, and when you look up back at Avery, you realize <<hes>> already gone.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You still should clean it up afterwards though.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Explain
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I'm a <<animalpc>>. Raw meat actually makes me happy."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm a <<animalpc>>, what did you expect? I'm a carnivore, I need meat."
<<else>>
	"I'm a <<animalpc>>. And it means I'm sort of a half-carnivore. I need meat. It makes me happy."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"I didn't ask for an explanation. Just take it. And make sure you cook it for me properly. The last thing I need is to get sick from undercooked meat again."
<br><br>
<<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Avery didn't mention it, but you probably still have to clean that kitchen.<</if>> <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Raw Silent
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $phase is "beef">>"You could make steak tartare.<<else>>"At least put it on some bread.<</if>>", Avery starts. "There are better ways to phrase it. Some that don't make you sound like a barbarian." <<He>> sighs. "Do with it whatever you want.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Just clean it up first.<</if>>"<br>
<<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>> <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>

<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Child
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

"I need to feed my child."<br>
"Children don't eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>"<br>
"Wolf children do."
<br><br>
There is an uncomfortable silence between you two before Avery raises <<his>> voice.
<br><br>
"You have a child with some filthy animal!? Are you out of your mind?"
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed is 1>>
	Avery steps closer and grasps both of your arms. It hurts.<<gpain>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<pain 4>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
    <br><br>
	"Leave that $phase alone and don't even fucking mention that anymore. You're here, you're mine and I am not sharing you with any animal in that forest.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this mess.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<ggarage>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>>
<<else>>
	Avery takes a good while to compose <<himself>>, then forces a smile. "Don't go there anymore. It's not your life now.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this mess.<</if>>"<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Friend
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I thought about giving it to a friend. 
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"It's for a friend. 
<<else>>
	"I wanted to give it to a friend. 
<</if>>
<<if $phase2 is "wolf">>
<<nnpc_hes "Black Wolf">> A wolf.<<if $wolfgirl gte 6>> A bit more wolfy than me."<</if>>
<<else>>
<<nnpc_hes "Great Hawk">> A hawk.<<if $harpy gte 6>> A bit more hawky than me."<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed is 1>>
	"You wanted to give the food I buy to some random <<print $phase2>>? You're impossible. Put this <<recipe_name $phase>> back <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>and clean up this mess<<else>>don't do it again.<</if>><<gstress>><<stress 6>><<ggarage>><<npcincr Avery rage 2>>
<<else>>
	"You wanted to give the food I buy to some random <<print $phase2>>? You..." Avery stops and takes a deep breath, forcing a smile on <<his>> face. "You don't need to do this. If you want to feed stray animals, buy treats for them in the shopping centre and leave the good-quality meat for us, hm?" <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Now, clean this up.<</if>><<gstress>><<stress 6>><<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Avery's gaze follows your hands till you put the <<recipe_name $phase>> down. <<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

"I really like honey."<br>
"It's a honeycomb, not honey."<br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"But I really like it from the source," you answer almost automatically, your animalistic nature taking controle for a moment. Avery just stares at you for a moment waiting for further explanation.
<<else>>
	"It's better fresh from the source," you answer automatically, your animalistic nature taking controle for a moment. Avery just stares at you for a moment waiting for further explanation.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Bite into the honeycomb to prove a point|Mansion Steal Honey Prove]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Explain|Mansion Steal Honey Explain]]>><</link>><br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Mansion Steal Honey Silent]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey Prove
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

You bite into the honeycomb slowly. You make some mess, but it doesn't matter much, as it makes something inside you very happy.
<br><br>
Soon enough the whole honeycomb is in your belly and you want to take a bit more. When you look up back at Avery, you realize <<hes>> already gone.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> You still should clean it up afterwards though.<</if>>
<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 1>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Honey Explain
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I'm a bear<<girl>>. So I can eat a whole honeycomb and not get sick."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm a bear<<girl>>. Isn't eating honey like, very typical for a bear?"
<<else>>
	"I'm a bear<<girl>>. And it means I actually ate it before, and it's very tasty for me. I could eat a whole beehive really."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Is it why you asked me to store it in the first place?" <<He>> raises an eyebrow. "They aren't easy to get, so don't take too many.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean up that mess.<</if>> 
<br><br>
<<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

