<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

"This is disgusting. Just make honey with it.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>" Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Surprise
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"But if I tell you, the surprise will be spoiled..."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Can't tell you, it'll ruing the surprise."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to make you a surprise!"
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<switch $phase>>
<<case "beef">>
	"A surprise?" Avery smiles at that. It seems <<he>> has something on <<his>> mind. "That sounds good. If it's what I think, make sure to make it rare.
<<case "pasta">>
	"A surprise?" Avery smiles at that. "<<if !Array.isArray($foodstuff["linguine"].knownFavorite)>>I hope you get it right. I do have something on my mind.<<else>>Are you making me linguine? I can't wait.<</if>>
<<case "sugar">>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Making me a dessert? How sweet of you.
<<case "flour">>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Are you baking me something?
<<default>>
	"A surprise?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Alright, I won't pry.
<</switch>>
<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Just clean it up first.<</if>>" Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Mansion Steal Admit 2
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I wanted to take it with me... Without asking your first."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"For, uh stealing from you. Sorry"
<<else>>
	"For stealing from you. I'm sorry"
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100)>>
	"So that's how it is?" Avery's eye twitches. "I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me to do what? Sell it yourself and get away from me? You have the nerve." <<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm.<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	"And you think I will simply forgive you?" Avery scoffs. "Put it down and don't do it again.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean it up.<</if>>"<<npcincr Avery rage 2>><<ggarage>>
	<br><br>
	<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

