			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"I'm a bear<<girl>>, eating honeycombs is pretty normal for me. Wax and larves and such," you must have gotten a bit too much into the detail because Avery stopped you.<br>
			<<else>>
				"I really like eating honeycombs. Wax and all. And the larves," you must have gotten a bit too much into the detail because Avery stopped you.<br>
			<</if>>
