			<</if>>
			"Candles?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, slightly surprised. "I didn't know you were interested in such things. Well, just make sure for it to not go to waste. They are hard to come by.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And also - clean that mess before somebody gets injured.<</if>>"
		<</if>>
