		<br>Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
	<<case "chicken_egg">>
		<<if $fox gte 6 or ($transformationParts.fox.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.fox.tail isnot "disabled")>>
			<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
				"I'm sorry, I just wanted to bury the egg," you start your explanation. "I'm a fox<<girl>>, and I really felt like I needed it."<br>
			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"I'm a fox<<girl>>. I felt the need to bury an egg, so I took the egg."<br>
			<<else>>
				"I wanted to bury the egg," you start your explanation. "I'm a fox<<girl>>, it's my natural need."<br>
			<</if>>
			Avery chuckled. "You wanted to bury it, obviously. I suppose you do look the part. 
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
				Well, you still have to clean it up, my <<= $player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "kit" : "vixen">>." <<He>> sighs. "Take that egg, just don't break anything more.
			<<else>>
				Just leave that for the maids to clean." <<He>>  stops and then sighs. "You can take that egg, just don't break anything more.
			<</if>>
			"<br><<He>> leaves the kitchen.
			<<tending_pick $phase 1 1>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
				"I was planning to make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you explain.
			<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
				"I wanted to make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say nonchalantly.
			<<else>>
				"I wanted to make <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>," you say smoothly.
			<</if>>
			<<if ($foodstuff[$phase2].recipe)>>
				If only you knew how to make it.<br>
				"<<recipe_name $phase2 "cap">>?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow. "I didn't know you could cook <<recipe_name $phase2 "article">>. So you are good at something. <<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean it up.<<else>>Don't let me catch you breaking anything again.<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<br>
				"Hm, makes sense," <<he>> steps away from the doorframe. 
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					"Clean it up. 
				<<else>>
