<<else>>
	"I'm sorry," you start. "I tried to steal from you."
<</if>>
<br><br>
"So that's how it is?" Avery's eye twitches. "I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me to do what? Sell it yourself and get away from me? You have the nerve." <<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm.<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
