			"Who said you can drink it? Put it down.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean the mess you've made.<<else>> And don't break anything else.<</if>>
			<br><br>
            Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
		<<case "salt" "black_pepper">>
			"You wanted to stash <<recipe_name $phase>>? What else do you have there that needs seasoning?" Avery raises <<his>> eyebrow, but doesn't give you a chance to answer. "Whatever you want to cook, just make it in the kitchen. That's what it's for after all.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean this up first.<<else>> And don't break anything else.<</if>>"
			<br>Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
		<<case "pork" "beef">>
			<<if (($wolfgirl gte 6 or ($transformationParts.wolf.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.wolf.tail isnot "disabled")) or ($harpy gte 6 or ($transformationParts.bird.wings isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.bird.wings isnot "disabled")) or ($cat gte 6 or ($transformationParts.cat.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.cat.tail isnot "disabled")) or ($bear gte 6 or ($transformationParts.bear.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.bear.tail isnot "disabled")) or ($fox gte 6 or ($transformationParts.fox.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.fox.tail isnot "disabled")))>>
				"Raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"
                <br><br>
				<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
					"I'm a <<animalpc>>. Raw meat actually makes me happy."<br>
				<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
					"I'm a <<animalpc>>, what did you expect? I'm a carnivore, I need meat."<br>
				<<else>>
					"I'm a <<animalpc>>. And it means I'm sort of a half-carnivore. I need meat. It makes me happy."<br>
				<</if>>
				"It still stays in the fridge. If you want to eat it, do it directly from here."<br>
				<<He>> turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>><<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Avery didn't mention it, but you probably still have to clean that kitchen.<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<if ($cow gte 6 or ($transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "disabled")) and $phase is "pork">>"How ironic."<<else>>"Is it a joke?<</if>> So you wanted to eat raw <<recipe_name $phase>>? Seriously?"
				<br><br>
				You struggle to find any explanation. Not like Avery gives you much time.
                <br><br>
				"So that's what it is? A coverup?" Avery's eye twitches. "I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me to do what? Sell it yourself and get away from me? You have the nerve." <<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm.<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
				<br><br>
				<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
				<<link [[Next|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<default>>
