:: Mansion Steal Snack Rage
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"I just wanted a snack, but I broke a jar by accident. I'm sorry"
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I wanted to get a snack, the jar fell down."
<<else>>
	"I wanted to get a snack, but a jar fell and broke. I'm sorry"
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "fruit" or setup.foodstuff[$phase].category is "vegetable">>
	<<if $phase is "lemon" or $phase is "lime">>
		"$phase? You made this mess to snack on <<recipe_name $phase>>?" Avery winces at the idea. <<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>"So that's what your cravings are.<<else>>"At least put some sugar on it.<</if>>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Still - clean this up first.<<else>> Still - be more careful in the future.<</if>>"
		<br><br>
        Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
		<br><br>
        You decide to still take some. <<tending_pick $phase 2 4>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "chilli_pepper">>
		"How very brave of you.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> Clean this up this mess and leave the pepper here.<<else>> Leave it here.<</if>> You can burn your throat in the kitchen."
		<br><br>
        Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "wheat">>
		<<if $cow gte 6 or ($transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "disabled")>>
			"You want to snack on wheat." Avery raises <<her>> eyebrow. "How very fitting. Still - leave it here.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<<else>>
			"You wanted to eat wheat?" <<He>> raises <<his>> eyebrow. "Oh you are not taking it anywhere, put it down this second.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> And clean the mess you've made.<</if>>"
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
        Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $phase is "rice">>
		"You wanted to eat uncooked rice?
		<<if $cow gte 6 or ($transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "hidden" and $transformationParts.cow.tail isnot "disabled")>>
			<br>You just moo in response and prove your point by putting the grain in your mouth. It's actually not that bad.<br>
			"That's your answer? Did you forget how to speak?" <<He>> sighs. "<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>Clean the mess,<<else>>Don't break anything more,<</if>>" <<he>> says clearly resigned.<br>Avery turns on <<his>> heel and <<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>returns to the dining room.<<else>>leaves the kitchen.<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
			You struggle to find any explanation. Not like Avery gives you much time.
            <br><br>
			"So that's what it is? A coverup?" Avery's eye twitches. "I take you in, provide for you, and you come here to steal from me to do what? Sell it yourself and get away from me? You have the nerve." <<He>> gets closer and grabs your arm.<<garage>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<npcincr Avery rage 3>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
