:: Avery Kitchen Steal
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<effects>>
<br>
You look through the cabinets and check the fridge.<br>
<<if $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "away" and $avery_mansion.schedule isnot "work">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 200>>
	Avery isn't home, so as long as you don't mess anything up, <<nnpc_he "Avery">> shouldn't find out.
<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
	Avery is in the dining room. <<nnpc_He "Avery">> shouldn't suspect you of doing anything unless you act suspicious.
<<else>>
	<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>>
	Avery isn't anywhere close, so as you don't mess anything up, <<nnpc_he "Avery">> shouldn't find out.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal.concat($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested)>>

<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Go Back|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: avery_mansion Kitchen Steal Result
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<set _housekeeping_time to 2*Math.floor(10 - $housekeeping / 200)>>	

<<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	You take the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">> from the cupboard. <<tending_pick $phase 3 6>>
    <br><br>
	You probably shouldn't take more or Avery will realize too much is missing.
    <br><br>
	<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Walk Away|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>><br><br>
	<<ingredientsSuppliesSteal $avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.normal.concat($avery_mansion.kitchen_stock.requested)>>
<<else>>
	<<avery_housework_change "kitchen" 2>>
	<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
	As you reach to take the <<recipe_name $phase "plural">>, you accidentally knock a jar off the counter, causing it to shatter.
	<<if $avery_mansion.schedule is "away" or $avery_mansion.schedule is "work">>
        <br><br>
		<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
			Avery isn't home to judge you, but you just provided yourself with additional <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes of cleaning.
			<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
		<<else>>
			Avery isn't home to judge you, but you spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning it up regardless.
			<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
	<<elseif $avery_mansion.schedule is "dinner">>
		<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100)>>
			<br><br>
			"What the fuck was that!?" You jump as you hear Avery's voice, clearly alarmed by the situation, and clearly not in a good mood.<<garage>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<br><br>
			<<if setup.foodstuff[$avery_mansion.food].recipe.ingredients.includes($phase)>>
				"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? Is it so much to ask for <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> to be ready when I come back home?
				<<He>> scoffs annoyed and looks barks back at you. "Clean up that mess. And hurry up."
                <br><br>
                <<He>> returns to the dining room.
				<br><br>
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					You will have to take care of it before <<he>> returns to the kitchen.
				<<else>>
					<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
					You spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning the mess you've made.
					<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
						When you look up at the clock, you notice it's after midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be pissed.</span>
					<<else>>
						You look up at the clock. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<<else>>
				<<if $avery_mansion.rage.dinner_missed >= 0>>
					"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? Are you trying to feed me a fucking <<recipe_name $phase>>?" 
					<br><br>
					<<He>> walks up to you and grasps your arm harshly. "You weren't planning on doing what I asked for again, didn't you? You just take and take from me and give nothing in return!"<<ggarage>>
                    <br><br>
					<<He>> steps closer and rolls up <<his>> sleeves.<<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
					<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban = true>>
					<br><br>
					<<ind>><<link [[Fight|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><</link>>
				<<elseif $avery_mansion.rage.dinner_wrong>>
					"<<recipe_name $phase "cap">>? So you aren't making <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> today?" 
					<<He>> scoffs. "Clean up that mess. And hurry up."
                    <br><br>
                    <<He>> returns to the dining room.<br><br>
					<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
