					<<else>>
						<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
						You spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning the mess you've made.
						<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
							When you look up at the clock, you notice it's after midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be pissed.</span>
						<<else>>
							You look up at the clock. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					"You don't even need <<recipe_name $phase>> for <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">>, and you're making a mess because of it? Can you not break anything at least once?" 
					<<He>> scoffs. "Clean up that mess. And hurry up."
					<br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room.
					<br><br>
					<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
						You will have to take care of it before <<he>> returns to the kitchen.
					<<else>>
						<<pass _housekeeping_time>>
						You spend <<print _housekeeping_time>> minutes cleaning the mess you've made.
						<<if Time.hour lte 1>>
							When you look up at the clock, you notice it's after midnight. <span class="red">Avery must be angry.</span>
						<<else>>
							You look up at the clock. <span class="gold">Avery is still waiting for dinner.</span>
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>			
		<<else>>
			<br><br>
			"What's happening?" 
			<br><br>
			You turn to see Avery standing in the entrance, alarmed by the noise.<<gstress>><<stress 2>>
			<<if setup.foodstuff[$avery_mansion.food].recipe.ingredients.includes($phase)>>
				<<His>> expression softens when <<he>> sees you holding <<recipe_name $phase "article">>. 
                <br><br>
				"You wanted to make sure the <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> is warm I take it? 
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>>
					Just clean it up after you finish.
                    <br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room. You will have to come back to it later. For now, Avery is hungry and angry.
				<<else>>
