                    <br><br>
					<<He>> returns to the dining room.
				<</if>>
				<br><br>
				<<icon "avery_kitchen.png">><<link [[Next|Mansion Kitchen]]>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<IngredientCheck>>
				<<He>> sighs noticing the mess. "It's not exactly time for culinary experiments right now," <<He>> leans against the doorframe. "Why do you exactly need <<recipe_name $phase "article">> for? I don't think it's part of <<recipe_name $avery_mansion.food "article">> recipe."
                <br><br>
				<<averyStealResponse>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $averyragerevealed is 1 and C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100)>>
